            "x": 64,
            "y": 560,
            "width": 736,
            "height": 288,
            "content": "## Test data assumption: a CDP account with guests and reservations\n\nRevinate has no sandbox. The Account ID of the connected Revinate Guest Data account (Client ID, Client Secret, Account ID) must hold at least one Rich Guest Profile and at least one reservation of any type.\n\nThis flow has never been run: no Revinate test credentials existed when the connector was built. Not confirmed against a live account: the page size of 100 the components ask for, `pageLimit=1` in the Make API Call step, and that `meta.page.limit` echoes the page size."
        }
